      "role": "user",
      "content": "Hey, I'm working on a draft for a paper about that new novel \"The Glass Border.\" I want to focus my argument on how the author uses the protagonist's journey to effectively deconstruct the narrow-mindedness and fear-mongering of the nationalist movement described in the book. Can you help me draft an opening paragraph that sets this up? I want it to sound academic but really drive home how the characters expose the flaws in that faction's logic.",
